    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You use <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Force\" title=\"The Force\">The Force</a> to bend light around yourself, wrapping you in shadows and making it difficult for enemies to tell where you end and the shadows begin. As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you grant yourself a +1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> until the start of your next turn.<br><br>You may select this Talent multiple times. Each time you select it, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus it provides increases by +1 (to a maximum of +4).",
